📚 Key Learnings

Building a complete MVP is more valuable than adding unfinished features.

Reliable AI integration requires proper error handling and testing.

Loading and empty states greatly improve user experience.

End-to-end testing helps identify issues before deployment.

Deploying regularly makes debugging production issues much easier.



